[{"text":"This can be trivially generalized to even chains, i.e.","anchor":"index-contractions","section":"Index contractions"},{"text":"\\[\\begin{align} \\bar{\\gamma}^\\mu \\bar{\\gamma}^{\\nu_1} \\dots \\bar{\\gamma}^{\\nu_{2n+1}} \\bar{\\gamma}^\\rho \\bar{\\gamma}_\\mu & = 2 \\bar{\\gamma}^{\\nu_{2n+1}} \\dots \\bar{\\gamma}^{\\nu_1} \\bar{\\gamma}^\\rho + 2 \\bar{\\gamma}^\\rho \\bar{\\gamma}^{\\nu_1} \\dots \\bar{\\gamma}^{\\nu_{2n+1}} \\end{align}\\]","anchor":"index-contractions","section":"Index contractions"},{"text":"Following formula for \\(\\gamma^\\mu \\gamma^{\\nu_1} \\dots \\gamma^{\\nu_n} \\gamma_\\mu\\) in D dimensions and n\\geq 3 is given in Veltman’s Gammatrica","anchor":"index-contractions","section":"Index contractions"},{"text":"\\[\\begin{align} \\gamma^\\mu \\gamma^{\\nu_1} \\dots \\gamma^{\\nu_n} \\gamma_\\mu &= (D-4)(-1)^n \\gamma^{\\nu_1} \\dots \\gamma^{\\nu_n} + 2(-1)^n \\gamma^{\\nu_3} \\gamma^{\\nu_2} \\gamma^{\\nu_1} \\gamma^{\\nu_4}\\dots \\gamma^{\\nu_n} \\\\ & + 2 \\sum_{j=4}^m (-1)^{n-j} \\gamma^{\\nu_j} \\gamma^{\\nu_1} \\dots \\gamma^{\\nu_{j-1}} \\gamma^{\\nu_{j+1}} \\dots \\gamma^{\\nu_{n}}. \\end{align}\\]","anchor":"index-contractions","section":"Index contractions"},{"text":"Another useful and more compact formula for the same expression with \\(n \\geq 2\\) was derived my R. Mertig","anchor":"index-contractions","section":"Index contractions"},{"text":"\\[\\begin{align} \\gamma^\\mu \\gamma^{\\nu_1} \\dots \\gamma^{\\nu_n} \\gamma_\\mu &= (-1)^n \\biggl \\{ (D-2n) \\gamma^{\\nu_1} \\dots \\gamma^{\\nu_n} \\\\ & -4 \\sum_{i=1}^{l-1} \\sum_{j=i+1}^{l} (-1)^{j-i} \\gamma^{\\nu_1} \\dots \\gamma^{\\nu_{i-1}} \\gamma^{\\nu_{i+1}} \\dots \\gamma^{\\nu_{j-1}} \\gamma^{\\nu_{j+1}} \\dots \\gamma^{\\nu_n} g_{{\\mu_i} {\\mu_j}} \\biggr \\} \\end{align}\\]","anchor":"index-contractions","section":"Index contractions"}]